'''Fade''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.  

== Appearance ==
Fade’s blade starts at a yellow at the tip, and gradually fades to purple, hence the name. The guard has a similar design as the blade, and the handle is solid black, differing from the rest of the knife.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Fade (Radio)|partner radio]] under the same name.
*Its model, designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/971173/profile/ SkySpell], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/Fade-Knife-item?id=288315111 here].

